# The protagonist: a young paisano, an ex hardware-shop clerk from General
# Pico of about 30 (age 0.538 = 30 years), medium build. A cream shirt
# with a small collar under a dark waistcoat, a baggy bombacha tucked into
# calf-high boots, the faja and rastra, a red neckerchief, a dark red
# poncho with cream bands folded over the left shoulder, its ends at the
# hip, and a gacho: a low flat crown, the brim a little down at the front.
# The garments are cut from the body by the converter.
#
# Lines MakeHuman does not know (it warns and skips them) are read by
# tools/mh2gltf.py: piece adds a garment cut from the body or a generated
# piece (see ../README.md). Credits in ../CREDITS.md.
